      "old_value": "Consumes a `Fighter_GObj*` and reads its associated `Fighter.kind`. For Kirby, it passes the object to `Fighter_ChangeMotionState` with destination WalkFast, no transition flags, animation frame 0, playback speed 1, blend 0, and no alternate animation source, then writes true to `x2219_b2` and `x2219_b1`. For non-Kirby fighters, it forwards the object through the local inline chain to ftCo_800C7070, which supplies RebirthWait with the same entry parameters and performs the same two writes.",
