      "reason": "Demo caller installs alternate motion tables; ordinary-state enum spelling does not establish the selected animation or a respawn purpose.",
      "replacement": "Selects state ID 17 (spelled ftCo_MS_WalkFast) for Kirby and delegates all other kinds to ftCo_800C7070, which selects ID 13 (spelled RebirthWait). Both paths enter at frame 0, speed 1, blend 0 and flags 0, then set x2219_b2 and x2219_b1. In the demonstrated demo caller, alternate motion tables map these IDs to Kirby JumpB and common Run, respectively.",
